	(text "VS-8ETU04S + RC snubber, 3 x 100 uF polymer, ATL431 + CNY65B fast-lane type II\nwith R-C feed-forward, TPS3700 window -> SN74LVC1G17 -> PG_HVAUX (active high),\noutput connector (interfaces.AUX)"
