	(text "LAYOUT (not dimensions): reinforced HV <-> PELV for 1000 V DC, PD2, OVC II (IEC 62477-1 / 62109-1, ECO-10); only T1 and the CNY65B cross; 1000 V spacing between HV nets and between the ports; >= 4 cm2 2-oz Cu per SMCJ70A; VDD follower <= 85 C, away from T1 / SiC / clamp (sim"
